PR at the meat plant.

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.039
He wasn't even at work when I went.

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:35.240
He was asleep in his dorm.

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:38.160
Don't you work at the Culture Center?

00:21:38.200 --> 00:21:39.119
What brings you here?

00:21:40.759 --> 00:21:43.319
There's an English recitation contest.

00:21:43.559 --> 00:21:44.920
They asked me to coach them.

00:21:47.519 --> 00:21:48.359
And

00:21:49.119 --> 00:21:49.640
this one.

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:50.119
Wang Tao.

00:21:51.599 --> 00:21:52.279
Single.

00:21:52.559 --> 00:21:53.359
Folks live back home.

00:21:53.759 --> 00:21:55.720
Lives alone in company housing.

00:21:56.279 --> 00:21:57.480
So he's got his own place.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:58.920
How's that place you're renting?

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:00.200
Pretty good.

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.599
Good layout, good price.

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:04.319
Other criteria?

00:22:04.440 --> 00:22:05.119
He fit those too?

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:06.680
Like

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:08.440
living away from family.

00:22:08.599 --> 00:22:09.039
Yes.

00:22:09.160 --> 00:22:09.599
And

00:22:10.400 --> 00:22:11.960
any collecting habits.

00:22:12.799 --> 00:22:13.960
Those, I think,

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:14.960
fit better

00:22:15.200 --> 00:22:17.279
with the killer's deviant behavior.

00:22:17.759 --> 00:22:19.559
It's for collection?

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:21.240
And study.

00:22:25.079 --> 00:22:25.880
Call Du.

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:27.519
Call the provincial lab.

00:22:27.599 --> 00:22:28.680
Test Zhou Xijie's blood first.

00:22:29.759 --> 00:22:30.519
Go, go.

00:22:31.079 --> 00:22:33.319
Sir, both tables are paid up.

00:22:33.359 --> 00:22:34.000
Let's go.

00:22:34.039 --> 00:22:34.400
Go.

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:40.560
(Taiping Gate)

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:49.920
Morning, Ms. Wang.

00:22:50.319 --> 00:22:51.319
Morning, Mr. Zhou.

00:22:56.319 --> 00:22:58.119
Everyone, line up.

00:23:04.680 --> 00:23:05.240
Where's Ma Na?

00:23:06.640 --> 00:23:07.480
Where did she go?

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:08.839
Know where she went?

00:23:09.039 --> 00:23:09.720
How would I know?

00:23:13.400 --> 00:23:15.960
Today's our final rehearsal.

00:23:17.319 --> 00:23:18.079
I'll ask again.

00:23:19.559 --> 00:23:20.160
Where's Ma Na?

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:22.160
Mr. Zhou.

00:23:22.319 --> 00:23:23.440
Ma Na took the day off.

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:24.720
Took the day off?

00:23:27.279 --> 00:23:28.279
Who approved it?

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:40.079
Keep going.

00:23:42.560 --> 00:23:45.560
(Trash Can)

00:24:12.200 --> 00:24:16.680
(Trash Can)

00:25:17.160 --> 00:25:18.640
(I'll always be watching you.)

00:25:56.640 --> 00:25:59.000
(What is true revenge?)

00:26:00.520 --> 00:26:02.640
(Making those you hate suffer?)

00:26:02.640 --> 00:26:06.040
(Su Lin's Diary)

00:26:07.000 --> 00:26:10.480
Piled one upon the other,

00:26:10.920 --> 00:26:14.359
would not reach from the ground

00:26:14.480 --> 00:26:19.200
beneath to the surface
of the water above.

00:26:19.759 --> 00:26:25.279
It's very very deep. So deep.

00:26:29.240 --> 00:26:29.839
What?

00:26:30.160 --> 00:26:31.839
Mr. Zhou, Ma Na's back.

00:26:42.480 --> 00:26:44.359
Today's our final rehearsal.

00:26:44.400 --> 00:26:45.039
You know that?

00:26:46.440 --> 00:26:47.640
And you still show up late?

00:26:50.000 --> 00:26:50.839
You have absolutely

00:26:50.880 --> 00:26:52.240
no team spirit.

00:26:54.359 --> 00:26:55.400
Someone like you

00:26:56.039 --> 00:26:57.200
doesn't deserve the lead,

00:26:58.359 --> 00:27:00.039
much less the Little Mermaid.

00:27:04.400 --> 00:27:05.920
What's wrong with him?

00:27:07.799 --> 00:27:08.359
Enough.

00:27:10.119 --> 00:27:11.559
Ma Na, get back in line.

00:27:13.359 --> 00:27:14.400
What a weirdo.

00:27:17.480 --> 00:27:18.599
Na just left like that.

00:27:21.119 --> 00:27:22.319
Ask her later?

00:27:23.440 --> 00:27:23.880
Go ahead.

00:27:24.640 --> 00:27:25.119
She's back.

00:27:25.279 --> 00:27:25.839
Ma Na.

00:27:27.720 --> 00:27:28.240
Na.

00:27:29.599 --> 00:27:30.119
Keep going.

00:27:30.359 --> 00:27:30.880
Na.

00:27:32.680 --> 00:27:33.200
What now?

00:27:34.119 --> 00:27:35.200
Zhao Lingling. Song Shuang.

00:27:37.599 --> 00:27:40.759
Far out at ocean,

00:27:41.279 --> 00:27:44.400
the water is as blue

00:27:44.400 --> 00:27:47.359
as the petals of a cornflower,

00:27:47.759 --> 00:27:49.839
and as clear as...

00:28:14.119 --> 00:28:14.880
Gu.

00:28:16.160 --> 00:28:16.799
I'm here.

00:28:18.200 --> 00:28:19.200
Give me a hand.

00:28:22.799 --> 00:28:24.799
(File Envelope)
Tai Wei asked me to give you this.

00:28:24.799 --> 00:28:25.759
I brought the kid

00:28:25.799 --> 00:28:27.039
some clothes and shoes,

00:28:27.079 --> 00:28:28.000
and some toiletries.

00:28:28.920 --> 00:28:29.920
Did you find her?

00:28:33.240 --> 00:28:34.119
I'm talking to you.

00:28:35.319 --> 00:28:36.480
Moving stuff?

00:28:39.920 --> 00:28:40.599
This guy...

00:28:41.599 --> 00:28:42.599
I'm asking you.

00:28:42.720 --> 00:28:43.440
Say something.

00:28:44.480 --> 00:28:45.640
You look out of it.

00:28:52.240 --> 00:28:53.400
Did you find her?

00:28:54.559 --> 00:28:55.559
Are you gonna answer me?

00:28:55.799 --> 00:28:56.440
I found her.

00:28:57.000 --> 00:28:57.599
Where is she?

00:28:58.359 --> 00:29:00.279
I found where Su Lin was living.

00:29:01.240 --> 00:29:01.640
Living?

00:29:04.920 --> 00:29:06.119
If I hadn't left yesterday,

00:29:06.119 --> 00:29:07.079
if I'd stayed there,

00:29:07.119 --> 00:29:08.720
I might've seen her.

00:29:08.759 --> 00:29:10.519
I could've brought her home.

00:29:10.880 --> 00:29:11.720
Where'd you go?

00:29:11.799 --> 00:29:13.000
After I took you home,

00:29:13.039 --> 00:29:14.319
I followed Wu's map

00:29:14.359 --> 00:29:15.359
and went back down.

00:29:15.559 --> 00:29:17.079
I followed the route on the map.

00:29:17.440 --> 00:29:18.440
We found a room.

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:19.400
I went inside.

00:29:19.519 --> 00:29:21.359
Su Lin's clothes were there,

00:29:21.519 --> 00:29:22.440
and her backpack.

00:29:22.559 --> 00:29:24.000
I'm sure she'd been

00:29:24.039 --> 00:29:25.720
living there all this time.

00:29:26.119 --> 00:29:27.240
How was I supposed to know?

00:29:27.240 --> 00:29:28.200
While we were waiting,

00:29:28.200 --> 00:29:30.200
Jiang Ting's mom had low blood sugar.

00:29:30.759 --> 00:29:32.240
Her mom went with you?

00:29:32.400 --> 00:29:33.440
As I was going down

00:29:33.480 --> 00:29:34.680
at Culture Square,

00:29:34.720 --> 00:29:35.759
her mom was there.

00:29:35.799 --> 00:29:37.000
She'd promised Jiang Ting

00:29:37.079 --> 00:29:37.920
she'd find Su Lin.

00:29:37.960 --> 00:29:39.200
So I let her come with me.

00:29:39.359 --> 00:29:40.960
I told her her blood sugar was low.

00:29:41.039 --> 00:29:41.599
Go home.

00:29:41.640 --> 00:29:42.440
I'd stay and wait.

00:29:42.680 --> 00:29:44.079
She wouldn't. She insisted on staying.

00:29:44.160 --> 00:29:45.599
Finally, I knew she couldn't stay.

00:29:45.920 --> 00:29:47.640
I couldn't let her get hurt down there.

00:29:47.960 --> 00:29:49.359
So I took her home.

00:29:49.799 --> 00:29:50.759
Once I got her home,

00:29:51.039 --> 00:29:52.400
I came right back.

00:29:52.440 --> 00:29:53.880
But when I entered the room,

00:29:55.240 --> 00:29:55.960
gone.

00:29:57.039 --> 00:29:58.960
Su Lin's clothes I'd just seen,

00:29:59.160 --> 00:29:59.839
her backpack...

00:29:59.880 --> 00:30:00.640
all gone.

00:30:00.680 --> 00:30:01.799
Everything connected to her

00:30:01.839 --> 00:30:02.720
was gone.

00:30:02.759 --> 00:30:03.640
Cleared out.

00:30:04.079 --> 00:30:05.000
She moved?

00:30:05.240 --> 00:30:06.200
I don't know.

00:30:06.640 --> 00:30:07.880
I don't know if she moved.

00:30:08.400 --> 00:30:09.480
Then where could she be?

00:30:09.720 --> 00:30:11.039
She's just a kid.

00:30:11.200 --> 00:30:12.960
If she got out of the sewer herself,

00:30:13.400 --> 00:30:14.359
wouldn't she go home?

00:30:14.440 --> 00:30:14.799
Yeah.

00:30:15.119 --> 00:30:15.680
So I thought,

00:30:15.720 --> 00:30:17.039
maybe she couldn't get home before,

00:30:17.160 --> 00:30:18.319
but made it back now.

00:30:18.440 --> 00:30:19.599
So I rushed back.

00:30:20.119 --> 00:30:20.839
Know why

00:30:20.839 --> 00:30:21.920
I waited there all night?

00:30:22.359 --> 00:30:24.000
I was afraid I'd fall asleep,

00:30:24.119 --> 00:30:25.039
miss her coming in,

00:30:25.039 --> 00:30:26.000
and miss her again.

00:30:26.680 --> 00:30:27.200
And

00:30:27.640 --> 00:30:28.319
the sewer.

00:30:29.039 --> 00:30:30.079
Where she was staying,

00:30:31.440 --> 00:30:33.240
I'm sure two people lived there.

00:30:33.519 --> 00:30:34.039
Then maybe

00:30:34.079 --> 00:30:35.680
someone be holding her?

00:30:35.680 --> 00:30:36.720
No, no.

00:30:36.720 --> 00:30:37.720
Held her?

00:30:37.759 --> 00:30:38.240
Kidnapped?

00:30:38.279 --> 00:30:40.200
Would a kidnapper care about clothes?

00:30:40.319 --> 00:30:42.079
Let her wash them and pack her bag?

00:30:42.160 --> 00:30:43.880
And that room was spotless.

00:30:44.119 --> 00:30:46.160
You mean she had a friend down there?

00:30:46.200 --> 00:30:47.599
I don't know if they were friends.

00:30:47.880 --> 00:30:49.039
But what we do know is

00:30:50.079 --> 00:30:51.119
there's a killer down there.

00:30:52.000 --> 00:30:53.240
The bodies were found

00:30:53.400 --> 00:30:54.759
far from where she lived.

00:30:56.160 --> 00:30:57.160
Could that one be the killer?

00:30:58.839 --> 00:31:00.359
How's Su Lin tied to the killer?

00:31:03.279 --> 00:31:04.599
No. This is too dangerous.

00:31:05.200 --> 00:31:06.599
Did you call Tai Wei?

00:31:08.200 --> 00:31:08.920
I forgot.

00:31:14.200 --> 00:31:15.039
Hello? Tai Wei?

00:31:16.119 --> 00:31:16.640
(Gu.)

00:31:17.160 --> 00:31:18.480
(I found out what you asked.)

00:31:18.920 --> 00:31:19.519
What was it?

00:31:20.720 --> 00:31:22.200
(That security company)

00:31:22.200 --> 00:31:23.079
(that hired you to train.)

00:31:23.640 --> 00:31:24.440
Security company?

00:31:24.640 --> 00:31:25.160
What?

00:31:26.680 --> 00:31:29.119
(It's backed by Zhongyu Construction.)

00:31:32.720 --> 00:31:33.599
Zhongyu Construction?

00:31:34.880 --> 00:31:36.039
The one here in Chaobei?

00:31:36.720 --> 00:31:37.119
(Yeah.)

00:31:37.799 --> 00:31:38.960
(A top local company.)

00:31:39.599 --> 00:31:40.200
Got it.

00:31:40.960 --> 00:31:41.359
(Okay.)

00:31:50.920 --> 00:31:52.600
(Mr. Ma / Unknown Boss
Zhongyu Owner)

00:31:52.600 --> 00:31:53.560
(Capt. Li / Employed)

00:31:53.560 --> 00:31:54.960
(Dingsheng Crew
Zhongyu Construction)

00:32:01.079 --> 00:32:02.160
I need to find Tai Wei.

00:32:02.640 --> 00:32:03.559
Right now.

00:32:15.440 --> 00:32:15.880
Dongchen.

00:32:16.240 --> 00:32:17.200
Never came out all night.

00:32:17.720 --> 00:32:18.920
A woman went in this morning.

00:32:21.359 --> 00:32:22.400
Okay. Got it.

00:32:23.160 --> 00:32:23.839
Get some sleep.

00:32:24.559 --> 00:32:25.480
I'm off, then.

00:32:38.599 --> 00:32:39.160
Go on home.

00:32:39.319 --> 00:32:39.720
Okay.

00:32:39.839 --> 00:32:40.640
Don't worry.

00:32:41.559 --> 00:32:42.039
Go.

00:32:53.440 --> 00:32:54.079
Mr. Gu.

00:33:01.839 --> 00:33:02.519
Ma Dongchen.

00:33:03.680 --> 00:33:04.279
Mr. Ma.

00:33:06.559 --> 00:33:07.599
Big boss like you

00:33:08.440 --> 00:33:09.240
waiting here for me?

00:33:10.160 --> 00:33:10.759
Something up?

00:33:13.319 --> 00:33:13.880
Well.

00:33:14.240 --> 00:33:16.640
I've got a personal matter.

00:33:17.200 --> 00:33:18.960
I'd like your advice on.

00:33:19.319 --> 00:33:20.680
Got a minute?

00:33:24.759 --> 00:33:25.400
A quick chat.

00:33:48.880 --> 00:33:49.839
I should've

00:33:50.039 --> 00:33:51.799
invited you somewhere nicer

00:33:51.920 --> 00:33:53.279
for tea,

00:33:53.799 --> 00:33:55.640
but it's urgent,

00:33:56.279 --> 00:33:58.400
and I wanted some privacy.

00:34:05.920 --> 00:34:07.200
I've been a cop all these years.

00:34:08.559 --> 00:34:09.679
Never taken a dime.

00:34:11.480 --> 00:34:12.119
Mr. Gu,

00:34:12.480 --> 00:34:14.719
friends can help each other out.

00:34:15.000 --> 00:34:16.800
Nothing wrong with that.

00:34:17.440 --> 00:34:17.920
Don't.

00:34:19.039 --> 00:34:20.239
We're not that close.

00:34:21.039 --> 00:34:22.159
And we're not friends.

00:34:26.039 --> 00:34:26.880
If you have something to say,

00:34:27.440 --> 00:34:28.079
say it.

00:34:53.000 --> 00:34:53.440
Fine.

00:34:57.239 --> 00:34:58.119
Then

00:34:58.480 --> 00:34:59.599
let me tell you a story.

00:35:01.079 --> 00:35:02.039
There was a man

00:35:03.119 --> 00:35:04.239
who happened to notice

00:35:04.880 --> 00:35:06.800
his neighbor's daughter

00:35:06.880 --> 00:35:08.079
hadn't come home for days.

00:35:08.800 --> 00:35:10.960
So he searched everywhere.

00:35:11.719 --> 00:35:13.360
But the girl

00:35:13.880 --> 00:35:15.360
had just gone away to school.

00:35:16.280 --> 00:35:17.599
Life's funny.

00:35:18.840 --> 00:35:20.079
You meet someone,

00:35:20.760 --> 00:35:22.000
become neighbors,

00:35:22.800 --> 00:35:24.079
and before you know it,

00:35:24.159 --> 00:35:25.239
they move away.

00:35:25.760 --> 00:35:27.360
Maybe you never see them again.

00:35:28.360 --> 00:35:29.920
My point is,

00:35:30.719 --> 00:35:32.800
we should mind our own business.

00:35:34.559 --> 00:35:36.239
That's best.

00:35:37.599 --> 00:35:38.360
Don't you think?

00:35:42.480 --> 00:35:43.800
You like stories, Mr. Ma.

00:35:46.280 --> 00:35:47.920
Then here's one for you.

00:35:49.599 --> 00:35:50.480
There was a girl.

00:35:51.639 --> 00:35:52.360
Let's call her

00:35:53.760 --> 00:35:54.519
Girl A.

00:35:56.440 --> 00:35:57.719
She had a classmate.

00:35:59.480 --> 00:36:00.239
Let's call her

00:36:01.639 --> 00:36:02.599
Girl C.

00:36:04.719 --> 00:36:05.519
The two

00:36:06.360 --> 00:36:07.320
got into an argument.

00:36:08.159 --> 00:36:09.840
Girl A

00:36:10.639 --> 00:36:11.320
shoved

00:36:12.159 --> 00:36:13.280
Girl C into a sewer.

00:36:15.039 --> 00:36:16.639
Girl A's father

00:36:17.519 --> 00:36:19.559
tried to cover up her crime.

00:36:19.719 --> 00:36:21.360
He went to Girl C's family

00:36:23.079 --> 00:36:24.239
and made a deal,

00:36:25.519 --> 00:36:26.440
negotiated terms,

00:36:28.159 --> 00:36:29.000
paid them,

00:36:30.639 --> 00:36:32.800
got their son registered,

00:36:33.480 --> 00:36:34.679
and into elementary school.

00:36:36.079 --> 00:36:38.519
To stop them looking for her,

00:36:39.280 --> 00:36:40.440
he threatened them.

00:36:41.400 --> 00:36:43.719
He even

00:36:44.639 --> 00:36:45.880
crippled her father's leg.

00:36:47.360 --> 00:36:48.360
And that's not all.

00:36:48.639 --> 00:36:50.519
He locked the man looking for her

00:36:50.559 --> 00:36:51.480
down in a manhole.

00:36:53.400 --> 00:36:54.079
He even

00:36:54.639 --> 00:36:55.599
tried to use money

00:36:56.000 --> 00:36:57.199
to make every problem go away.

00:37:07.199 --> 00:37:08.199
Quite a story.

00:37:09.840 --> 00:37:10.840
But to be fair,

00:37:11.920 --> 00:37:13.599
it's a little too dramatic.

00:37:14.719 --> 00:37:15.880
Sounds made up.

00:37:16.679 --> 00:37:19.159
Like the mysteries my daughter reads.

00:37:19.679 --> 00:37:21.880
But even mysteries

00:37:22.519 --> 00:37:23.920
need evidence, don't they?

00:37:25.119 --> 00:37:26.320
You know, the police could easily

00:37:27.280 --> 00:37:30.199
check the shoeprints and fingerprints

00:37:30.840 --> 00:37:32.039
by the well, right?

00:37:32.800 --> 00:37:34.000
And that shoeprint

00:37:34.920 --> 00:37:35.679
was unusual.

00:37:36.440 --> 00:37:37.800
This is a small town.

00:37:38.840 --> 00:37:41.840
People who can afford imported shoes?

00:37:42.760 --> 00:37:43.440
Not many.

00:37:47.199 --> 00:37:48.360
Being a dad isn't easy.

00:37:51.039 --> 00:37:52.360
For his daughter,

00:37:54.480 --> 00:37:55.639
he must've been terrified.

00:37:57.039 --> 00:37:58.039
He panicked

00:37:58.320 --> 00:37:59.280
and made a mistake.

00:38:02.000 --> 00:38:03.199
Take that manhole cover.

00:38:06.079 --> 00:38:07.679
You piled all those bricks on it.

00:38:09.079 --> 00:38:10.519
I almost died down there.

00:38:12.639 --> 00:38:13.880
For his daughter's sake,

00:38:17.039 --> 00:38:17.679
he panicked.

00:38:19.519 --> 00:38:20.280
He was cornered.

00:38:22.000 --> 00:38:23.039
Had no choice.

00:38:24.000 --> 00:38:25.239
No other way.

00:38:27.880 --> 00:38:28.400
Really?

00:38:31.360 --> 00:38:32.599
The child makes one mistake,

00:38:34.000 --> 00:38:35.960
then the father makes another,

00:38:36.480 --> 00:38:38.480
covering it up for her.

00:38:39.559 --> 00:38:40.440
He goes further,

00:38:41.159 --> 00:38:42.119
keeps making it worse.

00:38:43.199 --> 00:38:44.519
Is that really helping his child?

00:38:46.119 --> 00:38:47.480
I've been a cop a long time.

00:38:48.840 --> 00:38:50.320
One thing I've learned,

00:38:51.440 --> 00:38:53.400
never think you'll get away with it.

00:38:54.840 --> 00:38:56.119
A kid's mistake can be fixed.

00:38:58.119 --> 00:38:59.800
But if a father gets tunnel vision,

00:39:01.920 --> 00:39:03.400
and turns to crime,

00:39:04.400 --> 00:39:05.599
there's no turning back.

00:39:08.239 --> 00:39:11.079
That's how you ruin your child's life.

00:39:20.840 --> 00:39:21.440
Mr. Ma.

00:39:25.000 --> 00:39:26.039
I have an old friend.

00:39:27.840 --> 00:39:30.119
I can take you to see him right now.

00:39:31.559 --> 00:39:32.960
Tell him what's on your mind.

00:39:34.119 --> 00:39:35.119
Maybe there's still

00:39:36.079 --> 00:39:37.039
a way out.

00:39:56.639 --> 00:39:57.159
Let's go.

00:39:58.840 --> 00:39:59.400
I'll drive.

00:40:00.199 --> 00:40:00.880
I know the way.

00:40:03.239 --> 00:40:03.639
Okay.

00:40:16.360 --> 00:40:18.119
(These materials must arrive tomorrow.)

00:40:18.519 --> 00:40:19.599
(The site's waiting.)

00:40:19.760 --> 00:40:20.559
(Find a way.)

00:40:21.239 --> 00:40:22.079
(Pay more if needed.)

00:40:22.320 --> 00:40:22.800
(It's fine.)

00:41:57.000 --> 00:41:58.000
Get in my way,

00:41:59.320 --> 00:42:00.840
and I'll make you disappear.

00:42:01.880 --> 00:42:03.400
Why do you keep

00:42:03.400 --> 00:42:04.159
targeting my daughter?

00:42:04.280 --> 00:42:04.840
Targeting her...

00:42:05.360 --> 00:42:06.079
Targeting her...

00:42:42.520 --> 00:42:45.040
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

00:42:48.280 --> 00:42:49.000
Go!

00:42:49.440 --> 00:42:51.400
If you ever bully Jiang Ting again,

00:42:51.639 --> 00:42:52.840
I won't let it slide.

00:42:53.159 --> 00:42:54.000
Got it?

00:42:54.880 --> 00:42:55.920
Anyone?

00:42:55.960 --> 00:42:57.239
Pack your things. Now.

00:42:57.480 --> 00:42:58.719
We fly to Los Angeles tonight.

00:42:58.719 --> 00:42:59.960
Did something happen?

00:43:00.719 --> 00:43:01.679
Listen.

00:43:01.800 --> 00:43:03.199
This is a murder case.

00:43:03.719 --> 00:43:04.840
Think carefully.

00:43:05.280 --> 00:43:06.400
You can tell me here,

00:43:06.440 --> 00:43:07.719
or back at the station.

00:43:08.440 --> 00:43:09.440
The provincial lab says

00:43:09.519 --> 00:43:10.639
Zhou Xijie's DNA

00:43:10.840 --> 00:43:11.960
doesn't match the killer's.

00:43:12.280 --> 00:43:13.840
He's not even type A.

00:43:35.200 --> 00:43:37.200
♪Darkness♪

00:43:37.200 --> 00:43:41.360
♪Spreads like ink♪

00:43:42.680 --> 00:43:44.600
♪Lost♪

00:43:44.600 --> 00:43:48.920
♪Eyes search the shadows♪

00:43:49.800 --> 00:43:51.520
♪So many♪

00:43:51.520 --> 00:43:55.920
♪stories hide in life's corners♪

00:43:56.840 --> 00:43:58.480
♪I remember♪

00:43:58.480 --> 00:44:02.200
♪Every joy and sorrow♪

00:44:02.240 --> 00:44:06.120
♪Till a dazzling beam breaks through♪

00:44:06.120 --> 00:44:09.600
♪I know that light is salvation♪

00:44:09.600 --> 00:44:11.440
♪The torn night♪

00:44:11.440 --> 00:44:12.880
♪Declares an end♪

00:44:12.880 --> 00:44:14.480
♪And loneliness, in this moment♪

00:44:14.480 --> 00:44:16.760
♪Fades into nothing♪

00:44:16.880 --> 00:44:20.160
♪I'll fight free♪

00:44:20.160 --> 00:44:22.960
♪Of the darkness♪

00:44:22.960 --> 00:44:27.040
♪And break the chains of fate♪

00:44:27.040 --> 00:44:30.960
♪Let me touch the blue sky above♪

00:44:30.960 --> 00:44:33.520
♪That light♪

00:44:34.240 --> 00:44:37.400
♪Suddenly falls♪

00:44:37.400 --> 00:44:42.400
♪Saving all my broken pieces♪

